  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0901a2c4257fd22c52617aee",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "黄是天子、蓝是圣母。\r\n吾则是琴蕾──\r\n亦即至高无上的存在！！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e19055298d3ebfdb026b1a96fc0818175b519318eb9675d83828a0da25861a33",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/91007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df25d88c61ced6ec75166312",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了到来之时，我将冲动\r\n深藏于体内。拘束器就是\r\n用以将其压制的装置……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f02d4d78b74bb49f0227897da0cbca4f8bd1016667f9c6c918213bf347dfa751",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/91008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3769eca200b0316e0ab88d6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要遵循无懈可击的例行项目，\r\n整理仪容再容易不过。\r\n这代的美发王称号就由吾拿下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc57f79e652bb6b267b8276ec5b5a9c608a079cfdb670f64b819c47477c3bebf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/91009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c44e6d12012f338fae7f0d3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "找到了充满活力的铁栅栏……！\r\n呵呵，哈哈哈！相遇的此刻，\r\n就是该挑战的最佳时机啊──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3ff6a4dc9f585bf926d37dad8e254ed5fa66286f152617c138a903756d04f39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/91010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90787519457befdb8f69c59b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是的……\r\n「魔性之人」真是棘手。\r\n还是重做一杯吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b8f0f804f879aee72b11a18cf452fad88069b40c15ba8d3673738d35697b3f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/91011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:673a6a50891e486b5e56b401",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我深爱着充满相遇与离别的\r\n这个季节。因为有欢喜与悲伤。\r\n因为有剎那与永恒之美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9219e22c50cf1ab468da74d2ccbfafa77065a51bbc2d6165e594c61247681d6d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/91012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:922f134a8dcfdd54fe30275f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在还不到解放这只眼睛的时刻……\r\n可不能屈服于炎热，解开束缚……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97213074f5e1b67e22a3ee87eb3793a5ea44ffea102bfd9cc259a2a07d18f2dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/91013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7b5f429867e9348487df967",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "阿瓦隆的果实很有用……\r\n──不过！那芳醇的香味\r\n对吾来说太甜了……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87622b2807fbca756a71780a8c3a12d70080d8a44f70a74b82003d189d4146a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/91014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c655d459c7d2c3555f70e8d8",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下雪的日子我偏爱读诗体埃达……\r\n众神运用力量与智慧互相争夺的景象，\r\n跟竞赛有共通之处。",
      "source_fingerprint": "719b5e10cba84b5ed7393601dc883f5a999bd20ea0d53c84d98010e1c531d2f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/91015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbb28619843a305adbc6698d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "理想的模样已经描绘完毕，\r\n接下来就开始实践吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e8837fa216c406e4aded26ecda511a68ef541d92bd50133b999b57168de8bfd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "92000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/92000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23fee3681c64e51c0bb50b74",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "行くぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b7d69ab49fc0641e5767000f10585546cf0c7394a41814a45559c8645634a6b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "920000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/920000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06021883a1b4a8f0f759246c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论多么严苛的困难都要挺身对抗。\r\n就像化作石像，却仍保有自身高洁的\r\n特洛伊祭司一样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "38b741dc28c2878627dd70d86c16342d3c66b54e3a3337b19850780b119ae818",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "92001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/92001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b7a2f0e2a2ecc21d374d385",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "惟有锻炼不需要矫饰。\r\n只要专注于实用性。\r\n来吧，你崭露智慧的时刻到了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "baf08c6a51275c9ac89e2e616e065b5024e5efa8db86a3357394553e3c5cb7f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "92002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/92002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8879aff613d8f0a7a2b3221",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的主观和你的客观，\r\n两者兼具才造就吾的完整。\r\n因此，我想听听你的意见。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fab635734e7e15b3c290c96d43eee23103889fabf77c4d861f10b993c236ad86",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "92003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/92003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4491b6c9830cd21fae0cb8f5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "据说古代的竞技者们，\r\n都是以初生的赤子模样在战斗。\r\n……呵呵，你想到什么画面了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "16205dd65853d41c1f356944d4c12261a4dac725cfe99237c8b896cf240182ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "92005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/92005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eedead0f13331623efe5eebf",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……呵，你可别一直发呆。\r\n如果轻易为我沉沦就不好玩了。\r\n你要慢慢、确实、稳健地……酩酊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61b8654f42bd5a9502ebc4ff8454163a0db5ec13483f1bc4966e97d9c1308b0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "92006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/92006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b4f7943805cfdc196366575",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "等时机到来，再来正式干杯吧。\r\n现在……你就沉醉于我这美酒。\r\n沉醉于这始终至高无上的吾吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3316a7f9586fd453bfe566ad7dc69469709a713dc83fe8d3b2abaaf0754d3acc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "92007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/92007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:294fe1e6af832a88d84b2ae9",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哦哦，融化万物的太阳啊！\r\n你打算连这双翅膀都要折断吗！\r\n呵──有意思，尽管剥夺吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9db959b6fdaf7bca3ace56f6eeb530230a1d746cecffdc47524ec95315d5981",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "92011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/92011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bf24b46872334afb511fffe",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈！！这才是极品美酒！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f9f7f16d903d377d5d9e36c1efae9642c2a1ce1f84988afa23eed4f4be72149",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "93000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/93000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4406e224e956021e900d7845",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一起举起庆祝的酒杯吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6e59379dbae0c1aa66145d5663f7ac61462302d441b0032203c71bb4c495f7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "93001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/93001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:878fe14cfda80b0cd6956548",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "获得更强大的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73f4dd9242a2670715ce87e6acfd7418e52bdbb7afa6fd3c3fd4c4a574c5085b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "95000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/95000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbc61184f865ce0188bc78b3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是时候踏出伊甸园了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a60b684823401be38c2ad7608bda5ef1a8da71d02d1e12ef1b7c0516542bdd0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "95001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/95001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d57a8ffc8c5b41cefdce668c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我是谷野美酒，为我酩酊吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c68ab83980781074d2005c4c2fc963e3a0316c8fffc13ca2a74c6c6a7e78812",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "95003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/95003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b2c53f8da2a60374853e120",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈！将我的、吾的剎那闪光\r\n烙印于眼中吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90ef3e051e09bbe40a8452983d8bbfd8651a72a2b3b4b1b94fed8b1f15f1d70c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "95004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/95004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1866c64aa59f2b35f813943c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "给你更加甜美的酩酊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "463d44d6926c1632abb65dcf7479e14e1b821d115938366ac19a897b97698379",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "95005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/95005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8d316c39ab6a019d42723ef",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "极限？刚才已经被我打破了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "539f73ac10fbf9aef8540659ca2dae432aa9627062b6671ccd6f382c59527220",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "95006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1084/95006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:103e5e3f9151c769a281c11a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "抬头挺胸，上场吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c1a3a21b9c1b3dd278436bb3ee2e6e0f8ceae566714bbf90920957dd9eb2f71",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "1000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1085/1000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38ceaa516cb915cfab6a8a6f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你就是我的训练员。\r\n请你善尽职责，\r\n勤于钻研。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd2327c36f02c14fe99b453c624c71caffb1440bc4b44ce9df89dc3fa64d9dbe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1085/10000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1477145eb944ce844c7bc9cc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "100000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1085/100000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6909154c1e0a5f401735ab17",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
